# OCRFlow Frontend

## Stack

- **Next.js** (App Router, latest) with TypeScript
- **Tailwind CSS v4** for styling
- **shadcn/ui** (Base UI primitives) for components — add via `npx shadcn@latest add <component>`
- **Framer Motion** for animations

## Routing

- `/` — marketing landing page (public)
- `/app` — main application (canvas, projects, pipelines)

Never send users directly to `/app` without a landing entry point.

## Brand

Brand assets live in `../branding/` (sibling repo). Copied assets are in `public/brand/`.

Use the OCRFlow 2026 design system (Segment mark + Pulse Violet):

| Token | Hex | Use |
|-------|-----|-----|
| pulse / primary | `#5B2EEF` | Accent, CTAs, active nodes |
| soft-violet | `#EDE9FE` | Tint, focus rings (light) |
| night | `#15131F` | Dark background |
| carbon | `#211D30` | Dark cards, panels |
| graphite | `#141225` | Primary text (light) |
| slate | `#6F6C84` / `#9A95B5` | Captions, muted text |
| mist | `#ECEAF2` / `#36314A` | Borders, dividers |
| paper | `#FAFAFC` | Light background |

**Logos:** Use `logo-lockup-light.svg` on light backgrounds, `logo-lockup.svg` on dark. `LogoLockup` switches automatically via theme. `SegmentMark` for inline SVG usage.

**Theme:** Dark is default. Toggle via `ThemeToggle` in the header.

**Typography:** Hanken Grotesk (display/body, weight 800 for wordmark), IBM Plex Mono (labels/code — uppercase, letter-spaced).

**Logo:** Horizontal lockup is primary. Segment mark (3 arcs + accent dot) for favicons and compact UI.

## Conventions

- Components in `src/components/` grouped by domain (`landing/`, `brand/`, `ui/`)
- Use `@/` import alias
- Match existing code style; minimal scope per change
- Canvas parity: anything doable in the UI must be doable headless via API/SDK (future)
